IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. AVERAGENNUMBERS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 I PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 N PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 USER-INPUT PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 S PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 AVERAGE PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY 'ENTER THE NUMBER OF VALUES TO AVERAGE: ' WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT USER-INPUT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > USER-INPUT
        DISPLAY 'ENTER THE NUMBER ' I ': ' WITH NO ADVANCING
        ACCEPT N
        ADD N TO S
    END-PERFORM
DIVIDE S BY USER-INPUT GIVING AVERAGE
DISPLAY 'AVERAGE: ' AVERAGE
STOP RUN.
